      "text": "“I’ve used FSD for like 90%+ of my miles since Saturday morning. Literally feels like magic. Has handled issues on the road better than I would have at times.\n\nJust remarkable technology”\n\nA demo drive might change your life\n\nhttp://Tesla.com/drive",
      "quote": {
        "author": "JSeyff",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1907158541619642368/Ol4x7X8N_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-22 00:51:21",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-09-21T16:51:21.000Z",
        "id": "2102078237132181589",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSwVA71W4AAdegO.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "name": "James Seyffart",
        "text": "I picked up my new Tesla model Y on Saturday. The whole process of picking it up took like 5 minutes. I never want to deal with a car salesman ever again. I immediately had the FSD drive me home for 45 minutes. I’ve used FSD for like 90%+ of my miles since Saturday morning. Literally feels like magic. Has handled issues on the road better than I would have at times. It saw a fox potentially running across the road last night before I saw it. Just remarkable technology. \n\nThank you to everyone who replied to my post a few weeks back saying I’d be an idiot not to get a Tesla. \n\nIt’s only been 2.5 days and idk that I can ever go back to a regular car as my daily driver?",
        "url": "https://x.com/JSeyff/status/2102078237132181589",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
