        "text": "Excited to bring 4.7 to you all! \n\nNumerics aside, it's incredibly capable in Grok Build/Cursor. We spent a lot of hours on the harness, iterating with some of the greatest engineers in the world. \n\nAlso, the fast mode has INSANE tps. Happy Grok Building :) Lmk what you think!",
